               "opportunity":  "For long-term AI-infrastructure holders, the market\u0027s sharp multiple reset has separated GLW\u0027s share price from accelerating fundamentals. Optical Communications is expanding margins rapidly as AI clusters shift from copper to high-density fiber, and long-term commitments from Meta, Verizon, and AT\u0026T provide rare multi-year revenue visibility through 2030–2032. As fiber penetrates deeper inside data-center racks via multicore cables and co-packaged optics later this decade, Corning\u0027s U.S. and European manufacturing scale positions it as a durable physical bottleneck beneficiary once technical selling exhausts itself.",
